4. Add or update only the five specified E6 records, preserving all supplied values exactly.
5. Match the existing column names and units. Populate only the six supplied fields with the values above.
6. Do not invent packet counts, RSSI start/end values, TX bitrate, channel, frequency, throughput, video quality, control status, timestamps, obstacles, or test notes. Preserve existing verified metadata if it is already available; otherwise leave unavailable fields blank or use the project's established missing-value convention.
