## 4. Validate the Data

Run appropriate checks to confirm:

- CSV parsing succeeds and every row has the correct number of fields.
- N1–N10 station identifiers are unique.
- Distances and measurement units are consistent.
- Packet loss is represented consistently as a percentage.
- RTT and RSSI values are parsed as numeric values.
